{"id":"wb-7-703","name":"良乡多宝佛塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"良乡多宝佛塔","text":"良乡多宝佛塔（另称昊天塔或良乡塔）是北京市内的唯一一座楼阁式砖塔，位于房山区良乡地区。该塔楼高五层，始建于隋朝，于辽代重建，曾遭到八国联军毁坏。该塔平面呈八角形，塔内各层建有回廊，塔顶为八角须弥座式塔刹。该塔先后于1979年和2013年被列为北京市文物保护单位和全国重点文物保护单位。1999年，该塔连同所在的昊天公园一并被良乡地区办事处非法承包给私企，租期为70年。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%89%AF%E4%B9%A1%E5%A4%9A%E5%AE%9D%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94","revisionId":91061829,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91061829","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9e0398f05f1a839204d6b126.jpg","title":"良乡多宝佛塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%89%AF%E4%B9%A1%E5%A4%9A%E5%AE%9D%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/%E8%89%AF%E4%B9%A1%E5%A4%9A%E5%AE%9D%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​良乡多宝佛塔","width":320,"height":432}}